WEBVTT

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:36.620
Searching for the
Claire Bible is one thing...

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:40.460
...but I can't be expected to find
anything when I'm THIS hungry!

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.290
That meatball's MINE!

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:45.660
They say you can't search
on an empty stomach, right?

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.930
I believe the saying is "You can't
FIGHT on an empty stomach."

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.410
What about when your stomach's
so full you can't move?

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:57.300
In that case, you have
to rely on your GUTS!

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.310
Got that? When the enemy's
attacking, you think saying...

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:09.650
..."My stomach hurts and I can't
move" will buy you any mercy?!

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:12.380
When that happens,
you fight with your spirit!

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.550
That's why you're born with
guts in the first place! Got that?!

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:15.690
Well said!

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:23.670
You've got a lot of promise!
Why don't you and l...

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:27.800
LOOK WHAT YOU MADE
ME DO TO MY MEATBALL!!!

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:33.040
An order of meatballs, please.

00:02:33.110 --> 00:02:34.440
At once, sir.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.960
Well, what do
you want with me?!

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:49.560
Will you play
brass rackets with me?

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.660
Brass rackets?!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.700
Brass rackets...

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.400
A popular battle game that
swept all over the land long ago.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:59.500
It's played by two
teams divided by a net...

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:02.440
...who hit a ball back and forth
using enchanted rackets.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.570
Hit the ball back and forth
with enchanted rackets?

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.740
Yes. According to this description.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.310
The hit ball's path can
curve all over the place...

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.080
...to attack the opposing team.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:17.050
A ball game that tests the
limits of strength and wits.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:20.460
That's all the "Top 100 Facts of
World History" has to say about it.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.530
And so?

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:28.530
You want me to play this
"brass rackets" thing with you?

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:30.170
Yes!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.200
My name is Rudo Balzac!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.740
I've dedicated my life to this game!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:39.340
I was going to compete this year, but
I haven't been able to find a partner!

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:41.350
And that's why you need me?

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:43.480
It sounds stupid!
Why would I do that?

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.310
Oh, and there's something about
the Claire Bible on the winner's cup!

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:50.580
The Claire Bible!

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:53.020
I'll do it! If Lina doesn't,
I'll do it myself! Is that okay?!

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:55.060
Oh, I'm afraid that's impossible.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:58.720
Brass rackets requires a
mixed male-female team.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.690
All right, then!

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:03.600
Mr. Zelgadis?

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:06.700
P- Please!
Play brass rackets with me!

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:09.330
Look, whatever,
but why do you want me?

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:10.670
You have guts!

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:11.970
Guts?

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:15.280
Don't you see? What lets
you win is having guts!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:20.340
I saw that clearly just before
when you got the last meatball!

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:23.250
Well, that's because she's
so greedy, you see.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.760
Why don't you just butt OUT?!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.160
When things are tough for your enemy,
things are tough for you, too!

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:29.630
But players who can
play through adversity...

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.460
...are the ones who
achieve true victory!

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:36.260
And the power that lets
you do that is having guts!

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:42.170
Are you still going on
about that outdated philosophy?

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.870
What the?!

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.790
That stuck-up laugh!

00:04:56.860 --> 00:05:00.160
Yes! I, too, shall be
competing in this tournament!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:00.890
Ma...

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.690
Miss Martina! Great outfit!

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.860
Keith...

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.970
Show them, Martina.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.400
Right, Coach!

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:59.450
What?!

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.190
GUTS!

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.810
Martina! When did you learn
to control the ball like that?!

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:26.900
Enchanted rackets amplify mental
energy and draw it into the ball.

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:29.740
The stronger the racket-holder's
personality...

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.650
...the more energy is released.

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.550
And she's got a LOT of
really warped mental energy, too!

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:35.950
Just shut up!

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.150
Keith! What is the
meaning of this?!

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:39.880
I'm sure you can guess.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:44.330
With this girl's wild personality,
she's just perfect for my needs!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:48.030
Miss Martina and I are now partners
and we intend to enter the tournament!

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.660
What?!

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:51.900
I know I've become
entangled in his plot...

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:55.960
...but I believe in Master Keith and
have been practicing his techniques.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.270
Yes. Brass rackets is a contest!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.840
And the key to winning
a contest is technique!

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:06.820
If you don't master the technique,
you can never achieve victory!

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.410
Can your quaint
notion of "guts" beat us?

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.980
Shut up! Your "techniques"
are just cheap tricks...

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:15.390
...designed to let you
hide behind your partner!

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.020
If you were a real man,
you'd face me in a real match!

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:21.730
Hiding behind your partner
is an excellent technique.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:24.530
The point of playing
is to win, after all.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:29.400
Exactly! And with Master Keith and I
working together, victory is assured!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:33.400
There's no way you
can beat me, Lina Inverse!

00:07:34.610 --> 00:07:39.110
This time... You will know
the bitter taste of defeat!

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:43.920
And what makes you think I'll
even compete? I think that...

00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:45.620
What about that clue to Claire Bible?

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.660
I'll do it!

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.030
You're scared, aren't you, Lina?!

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.160
Now accept my challenge!

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:57.000
Or isn't there enough room in your
breast for any hope of beating me?!

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:05.800
Damn that Keith...
I'll show him this time!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:10.810
Come on, Lina.
We've eaten, so let's get going.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.510
I'm playing...

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:17.460
That stuck-up girl!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:20.590
How dare she bring up the
thing I'm most sensitive about!

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.750
Miss Lina's REALLY burning mad!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:29.030
I accept this challenge!

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:32.930
Let's do it, Pops!

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:35.940
Right! Now that it's settled,
you need intensive training!

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:38.640
Huh? Intensive training?!

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.580
Lina Inverse...

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:49.590
As of now,
your true battle begins.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.520
When your body
and mind are exhausted...

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:55.190
...it's then that you must draw
upon your final reserves of strength...

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.530
...and rise to face the challenge!

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:01.520
All right! Let's begin!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:03.230
Well, that's easy
for him to say, but...

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:05.960
Is this really such a good idea?

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:10.240
Lina has to be the one to win.
This is the only way.

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:13.570
Oh, wow! You look
so serious, Mr. Zelgadis!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.550
I'm ALWAYS serious!
Now let's go!

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:18.540
Okay! Here goes nothing!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.480
What are you doing?! Hurry up!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.320
I hope she doesn't
haunt us if she dies...

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:29.260
I... believe in Miss Lina...

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:32.420
Hold it! Hold it!
What's that?! Is this a joke?!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.970
Guts, remember?

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:38.060
If you have guts, you can smash that
boulder to dust without a problem!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.870
Well, that's easy to SAY, but!

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.210
Okay! Here it comes!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:51.250
Lina! Hit that thing back
with all the guts you have!

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:53.920
Guts?!

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:02.750
Or isn't there enough room in your
breast for any hope of beating me?!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:10.430
It's little! Little!
Little! Little! Little!

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:16.040
DAMN YOU, MARTINA!!!

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:37.490
All right!

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.660
Well done, Lina! Just hang
on to those guts you have!

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.960
Leave this to me!

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.810
Looks like we can
expect quite a show.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.590
Let's go!
The Ultimate Guts Deathblow!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.370
Knock down!

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.850
All right!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.340
That's the way!

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:32.610
Miss Lina, you're great!

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:35.550
Aren't they supposed to
score POINTS in this game?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.880
Brass rackets is a battle game
played by controlling the ball.

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.490
As long as you keep the ball
inbounds of your opponent's court...

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:46.030
...you're allowed to
knock one of them down.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:50.530
And, in our next set, the
Frost siblings versus the team of...

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:54.130
...Martina Xoana
Mel Navrachoa and Keith!

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:57.700
Martina and Keith, now serving!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.640
Go! Snake's Hole!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.250
Knock down!

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:14.290
Oh, boy...
I wonder if Lina can beat her.

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.120
A most twisted,
high-speed technique.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.220
Truly deserving the
name of "Snake's Hole".

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:18.960
Amelia?

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:21.520
Huh? And Xellos is gone, too.

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.540
Winners: The Martina-Keith team!

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.840
Next up, the semifinals!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.740
Not bad.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.010
Neither are you.

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:42.340
I won't lose, though.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.550
Neither will I.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.290
The Lina-Rudo team versus...

00:12:52.570 --> 00:12:54.560
...the Amelia-Xellos team!

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:58.030
I know it's sudden, Miss Lina,
but I'm ready to play!

00:12:58.100 --> 00:12:58.760
Hello!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.430
XELLOS?! When did he?!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:04.370
Hey, you guys!
What's the big idea?!

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.500
Oh, well...

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:08.980
It was boring just watching you play,
so I decided to try entering.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:13.540
And Miss Amelia used her influence
to rotate us into the semifinals.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.650
That's how it happened.
Let's do it, Miss Lina!

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:18.950
Don't underestimate me just
because I got in on influence!

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.580
Hammer of Justice Serve!

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:26.400
I Have Nothing Against You,
But If I Don't Beat You...

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:29.160
...I Can't Face Martina
In The Finals Smash!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.480
Winners: the Lina-Rudo team!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.480
All right!

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:45.840
That was stupid...

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.880
Well, Lina, good luck!

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.250
Okay!

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:59.560
Lina, this is what decides it all.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:01.600
I hear you.

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:07.130
And now, the final match in the 378th
battle for the Brass Rackets throne!

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.470
I lost...

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:15.040
In the blue corner:
the Martina-Keith team!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:24.890
In the red corner:
the Lina-Rudo team!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:33.230
Now serving:
the Martina-Keith team!

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:42.900
This is the first time I've
had a real chance of beating Lina!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.100
I won't waste it

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.480
Here it comes!

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:55.350
Got it!

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.860
Lina!

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:06.990
Lina!

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:08.330
Lina, what's wrong?!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.990
That's funny... This racket...

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:12.470
What the?!

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:14.700
This racket isn't
made for brass rackets!

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:17.000
It's a just a fake
designed to look like one!

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.870
It's a what?!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:26.920
Exploiting your opponent's weakness
is the first step towards victory.

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:27.980
This is our chance!

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.950
What? What?
What's going on?

00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:33.480
Lina's racket has been
switched with another.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:35.160
With the results
being clear to see.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:40.090
So, is that gonna
hurt her somehow?

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:44.470
This game is played with
specially made rackets.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:49.300
If they aren't used, the player
can't amplify their emotional energy.

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:52.010
You can't play with this thing!

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:56.010
Damn it!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:07.650
This is cruel!
She's getting beaten up!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.690
This looks like as
good a time as any...

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:19.230
Oh, look!
Lina's racket is right here!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:25.240
Oh, dear. This must mean that I
was the one who switched Lina's racket.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.780
But why are you
confessing all of a sudden?!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:35.680
It would have been boring to
watch her finish this so easily.

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:40.550
It's better for Lina to
have a handicap like this.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:44.060
Now, let's see her show
us a really great match!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:47.860
Mr. Xellos, isn't that
logic sort of warped?

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.760
Lina!

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:53.700
LINA!!!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:55.860
That's...

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:57.740
My racket!

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:59.640
Take it!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:01.870
Thank you, Gourry!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.990
Look! Lina is declaring
a knock down attempt!

00:17:22.070 --> 00:17:25.300
Martina... You're going down...

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.970
That look she has...

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:34.640
Uh-oh... I think this game
just got a lot more dangerous...

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:43.280
She really has gone crazy!

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:45.720
Mega Brand Serve!

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:07.310
Damu Bras Serve!

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:25.200
You call that guts?!
That's just being really angry!

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:29.630
Shut up...
This time, we finish it!

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:32.740
DRAGON SLAVE SERVE!!!

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:34.930
What are you doing?!!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.840
NO, PLEASE!!!

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:44.420
Since the outcome of the
final match cannot be determined...

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.850
...not to mention that the two
competing teams were disqualified...

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:50.450
...and the other players
have all disappeared...

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:54.120
...the winners are
the Xellos-Amelia team!

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.690
Thank you very much!

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:05.970
I suppose this means that Xellos
ends up with the clue to Claire Bible.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.770
Mr. Zelgadis.

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:12.270
Here. You want to see this, right?
The clue to the Claire Bible.

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:16.310
Th- Thank you...

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.040
Oh, so that's how it ends up.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.610
I learned a lot today, but next
time I'll beat you, Dad!

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.490
It'll take you ten years
to ever beat me!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:33.020
Whoa, whoa, hold everything!
You mean you two are?!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:35.760
Oh, certainly.
This man is my own son!

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:39.690
They say when the lion throws
his cub into the deep valley...

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.540
...he also throws rocks at
him as the cub climbs up!

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.440
I don't think so...

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:48.980
So, which means what, exactly?

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:52.240
I was just a pawn in
your father-son rivalry?

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:56.220
That stuff about me being a
great partner was just a lie?!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.050
Uh, well...

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:02.990
Don't go spoiling his reputation!
I do this to train him!

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.300
You'll pay for this...

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:08.360
Lina, this one time,
I'm with you.

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:10.360
YOU'RE GONNA PAY!!!

00:20:11.900 --> 00:20:14.030
Come back here!

00:20:14.370 --> 00:20:16.710
What the heck is this?!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:19.710
It's says Claire GABLE,
not Claire Bible!

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.370
Claire Gable...

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:24.070
The name of the person
who invented brass rackets.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:26.980
Oh, dear. I must have
read it wrong before.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:29.890
You... You knew, didn't you?!

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:36.730
Now, please!
I really didn't know at first!

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:41.370
Didn't see that one...

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:44.260
Mega Brand Attack!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.130
Snake Hole Smash!

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:52.570
You know, those two really are
getting to be a lot alike.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:58.340
Come back here!
